J/ApJS/217/32     S4G galaxy morphologies in the CVRHS system     (Buta+, 2015)
================================================================================
A classical morphological analysis of galaxies in the Spitzer Survey of Stellar
Structure in Galaxies (S4G).
    Buta R.J., Sheth K., Athanassoula E., Bosma A., Knapen J.H.,
    Laurikainen E., Salo H., Elmegreen D., Ho L.C., Zaritsky D., Courtois H.,
